OL,3,GNEWSASocial media a factor in HMO
OL,4,Aattacks, says police boss
OL,5,
OL,6,FSocial media is in part behind a spate
OL,7,Fof recent "racially or religiously
OL,8,Fmotivated" attacks on houses in
OL,9,Fmultiple occupation (HMOs) across
OL,10,FGreater Manchester, a senior police
OL,11,Fofficer has said.
OL,13,FGreater Manchester Police said there
OL,14,Fhad been 46 properties damaged across
OL,15,Fthe city region since 5 October,
OL,16,Fincluding in Salford, Tameside and
OL,17,FStockport.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,410,400,260,160,0,100
