OL,1,W5j 5Q7kj 5j js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSASocial media a factor in HMO
OL,4,Aattacks, says police boss
OL,5,
OL,6,FCh Sup Marcus Noden said footage of
OL,7,Fcriminal damage was being shared widely
OL,8,F"followed by comments and discussions",
OL,9,Fand people were using social media to
OL,10,F"push the message out across different
OL,11,Fareas".
OL,13,FHe warned people to stop the attacks,
OL,14,Fwhich he said were "unlawful, reckless
OL,15,Fand putting lives at risk".
